{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1000_p", "source_sha256": "65fc63cd60696f211dbe0b9d25e852e88a01f1ffe96e0200a1b7202a67d237b6", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画のCM撮影。\n人気商品とのコラボで、美奈子にピッタリの……）", "zh": "（写真杂志合作企划的广告拍摄。与人气商品合作，而这个商品非常适合美奈子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "45712c33e6b86811e41b2c7493522a7c9089be9185cc9eb11e05012375de3937", "ja": "か、から～～～～～～いっ！！！！", "zh": "好、好辣～～～～～～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ceedfddcc50dde7edefaca1a6f00827e68a8c07818ca2256c3d70a33ddced193", "ja": "えっ、美奈子！？　どうしたんだ！？", "zh": "诶，美奈子！？这是怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "9722bacf5429533496f52ae41c91c73b5361dd62a99589eeaabdba8ddb2e4916", "ja": "「けどおいし～い♪\n火を吹くウマ辛、ドラゴンエビチリの素！」なんて♪", "zh": "“不过真的好好吃～♪\n喷火般又香又辣，龙虾仁辣酱的调料！”之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7a11273bcab3da06c6fa3efba20b670f934f7c03d636305f57bab482950beb35", "ja": "……なんだ、CMのモノマネだったのか。\n突然、叫び声が聞こえたからびっくりしたよ。", "zh": "……什么啊，原来是在模仿广告啊。\n突然听到叫声，吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "edbcacec4f9e775de655ce35ea94b8ef26f60a8df36dee481cd288e949ad5edc", "ja": "えへへ、すみません。でも感動しちゃって……\nパパッと手軽に作れる『ドラゴンエビチリ』の新商品！", "zh": "嘿嘿，不好意思。不过我实在太感动了……\n只要三两下就能轻松做好的“龙虾仁辣酱”新品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "c476816fef1bb755afe2d570a7cb9622fb0529175a35e6984a5dbf89954a8db2", "ja": "今、一口食べてみたんですけど、\n辛味と旨味のバランスがすごくちょうどよくて……！", "zh": "我刚刚尝了一口，辣味和鲜味的平衡恰到好处……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "f50f5ee09e8fa7a00114db7bdf3863a7915fe64775766b20e2b3390df1adfdd4", "ja": "うちとはまた違った味つけですけど、\nなんだか山盛りのご飯がほしくなるというか……。", "zh": "虽然是和我们家的调味不一样的风味，但总觉得会让人想要一大碗米饭……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "5b08d7528f6b24efa24a391476704086f8ac6c250dd0ae50fb5b80aecfa9c16c", "ja": "キャッチコピーどおり、まさに火を吹くウマ辛って\n感じでした！　ドラゴンの衣装にもピッタリですよね♪", "zh": "正如宣传语所说，真的是辣得火冒三丈、好吃过瘾！和龙的服装也非常相配呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bd7226ea3690d26834f35a84a342808b2e193f1f1aafecd663ace8b485a311f8", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。確か、この後は実食シーン……\nあ、だから出来立ての料理が。", "zh": "哈哈，说得对。记得接下来就是品尝环节……啊，所以才会有刚做好的料理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "69db43bbb9a47cd44579b63c0668a0fba013af2cb39be75420206855d7e185a9", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さんもどうですか？\n調理を手伝ってたら、作りすぎちゃって……。", "zh": "好！也来点{$P$}先生怎么样？\n我帮忙做饭的时候，不小心做多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d0a565496aeccf0e7399048c1e7a8b32be8e94c1dbe8a4123ff2301767aa9b76", "ja": "そういうことなら、一ついただこうかな。\nじゃあこの一番鮮やかな色の……。", "zh": "既然这样，那我就拿一个吧。\n那就要这个颜色最鲜艳的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "7b4964b433a1273f5b3c4bbc7c607ebaa3a8b2d8fbfd921768ddfbb56ca05074", "ja": "あっ、それは……！", "zh": "啊，那是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ad7e0efc53845248888db2756273a4f84e4d1c5abfbc1c180b90db3429fe8d8b", "ja": "パクッ……か、から……いたっ！！　ゴホッゴホッ！\nこ、これ……めちゃくちゃ辛くないか……？", "zh": "咬……好、好辣……好痛！！咳咳！  \n这、这不是辣得过头了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "443777ec7f03f4b8d975290c2eee69e3210f36caee4107529b3e1323d14eeb55", "ja": "{$P$}さんが食べたのは、限定の\n『竜辛（りゅうから）味』です。激辛のさらに上の。", "zh": "{$P$}先生吃的是限定的\n“龙辛味”。是在特辣之上的级别。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bafac7c8edd7c7119557a64c182eb07e94a7426feee41726eea2f0e7352e2bac", "ja": "そんなものがあったのか……。\n美奈子と同じものを食べればよかった。", "zh": "原来还有那种东西啊……\n早知道就该和美奈子吃一样的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "b7985442060e28c61b548c0a7af05eb4fbf422d2f77f489af2e864aec676c42c", "ja": "ちなみに、私が食べたのは激辛味です♪　そうだ！\nご飯用意してきたので、よかったら一緒にどうですか？", "zh": "顺便说一下，我吃的是特辣口味♪　对了！\n我带了米饭过来，要是你不介意，要不要一起吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0623_1017_p", "source_sha256": "df3885f3ac6fca23a288794de60ae76760ccf0dbcfec5e5c4a06ae083fa6ea8e", "ja": "なぜ、ご飯が……？　いや、でも……\nご飯があれば少しは辛さも和らぐか。いただこうかな！", "zh": "为什么会有饭……？不对，不过……\n有饭的话，辣味应该能稍微缓和一点。那我就吃了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
